DIY journaling is based on Jason Rowsell's prototype:
https://github.com/pulumi/pulumi/pull/22074
E Brake hardened and extended that basis with encrypted durable writes,
contiguous-prefix acknowledgement and replay, guarded checkpoints, epoch
identity and hash validation, native stack locking, crash-safe recovery and
consolidation, read-only isolation, evidence-preserving discard, backup and
retention support, compression handling, and multi-backend conditional writes.

